"Michal Brzozowski" <rusolis@poczta.fm> wrote:
>A floating eye can paralyze you even if you kill it in 1 turn.

This turns out not to be the case.

Defensive attacks with a damage type of AD_PLYS, such as the gaze of a
floating eye, are only resolved if the monster is still alive after the
damage from your attack has been resolved.
